# Nightly brew doctor: auto-fix safe issues (cleanup, relink), email a
# summary of anything needing a decision (deprecations, untrusted taps).
# Exits 1 only when the email could not be delivered, so the failure
# notification (banner + ntfy push) covers a lost report, not mere findings.
JOB_SCHEDULE="15 2 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-brew-doctor/brew-doctor.sh\" run"
